  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Family Planning 2030 - The Global Family Planning Partnership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The partnership aims to enable more women and girls everywhere to make informed, voluntary decisions about their contraceptive use, having children and participating as equals in society and its development.  It aims to disproportionately benefit the poor, including in countries where contraceptive uptake is low, or who risk being left behind.</narrative>
  </description>
